{"seq":1,"slug":"communities","title":"凝聚子群与社群","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-network-analysis/structure-and-community/communities","wordCount":1191,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"凝聚子群与社群\">凝聚子群与社群</h1><p>网络很少是均匀的——它通常由若干&quot;内部联系紧密、彼此联系稀疏&quot;的子群（社群）拼成。如何严格定义并自动发现这些社群，是 SNA 中观结构分析的核心问题。本节从社会学的经典子群概念（派系、k-核），讲到现代算法（模块度优化、Louvain），再到无人能绕开的难题——重叠社群与&quot;分辨率极限&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>社群结构分析的一组基本术语，先固定如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>社群</td>\n<td>内部联系紧密、彼此联系稀疏的节点子群</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>派系</td>\n<td>任意两两相连的节点集（完全子图），最严格的子群定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>k-核</td>\n<td>每个成员在子群内度 ≥ k 的子群（Seidman 1983），嵌套分层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模块度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>社群内部实际边数超出随机期望边数的程度，社群发现的核心指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Louvain</td>\n<td>贪心聚合的模块度优化算法，近线性，可处理上亿节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分辨率极限</td>\n<td>模块度优化会系统性合并小于某尺度的真实社群（Fortunato 2007）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"从派系到-k-核-子群的严格定义\">从派系到 k-核：子群的严格定义</h2><p>社会学最早用&quot;派系&quot;（clique）定义凝聚子群：一个派系是任意两两相连的节点集（完全子图）。但这一定义过于苛刻——现实中缺一条边就不算派系。于是发展出一系列放松的定义：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>苛刻度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>派系（clique）</td>\n<td>任意两点相连</td>\n<td>最严</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>n-派系（n-clique）</td>\n<td>任意两点距离 ≤ n</td>\n<td>较松</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>k-核（k-core）</td>\n<td>每个成员在子群内度 ≥ k</td>\n<td>嵌套分层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>k-丛（k-plex）</td>\n<td>每点最多缺 k 条内部边</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中 k-核（赛德曼 Seidman 1983）最实用：它通过反复删除度 &lt; k 的节点得到，揭示网络的&quot;层层剥洋葱&quot;结构，常用于识别网络的&quot;核心—边缘&quot;分层。这与<a href=\"../../social-stratification/class-mobility/class-theory-foundations\">阶级理论基础</a>中的核心—边缘隐喻相通。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模块度与社群发现算法\">模块度与社群发现算法</h2><p>现代社群发现的核心指标是&quot;模块度&quot;（modularity, Q），由马克·纽曼（Mark Newman）与米歇尔·吉尔万（Michelle Girvan）2004 年提出：它衡量&quot;社群内部实际边数&quot;超出&quot;随机情况下期望边数&quot;的程度。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></munder><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q=\\frac{1}{2m}\\sum_{ij}\\Big(A_{ij}-\\frac{k_i k_j}{2m}\\Big)\\delta(c_i,c_j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.7352em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 越高（通常 0.3–0.7 表示明显社群结构），划分越好。主流算法都以最大化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 为目标：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Girvan-Newman（2002）</strong>：反复删除中介中心性（边介数）最高的边，自顶向下&quot;切&quot;出社群，直观但 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 慢。</li>\n<li><strong>Louvain（Blondel 等 2008）</strong>：贪心局部移动 + 多层聚合，近线性，能处理上亿节点，是当前事实标准。</li>\n<li><strong>Leiden（Traag 等 2019）</strong>：修补 Louvain 可能产生&quot;不连通社群&quot;的缺陷，保证社群内部连通。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[社群发现] --&gt; B[子群定义: 派系/k-核]&#10;  A --&gt; C[模块度优化]&#10;  C --&gt; D[Girvan-Newman 2002: 删边介数最高边]&#10;  C --&gt; E[Louvain 2008: 贪心聚合 近线性]&#10;  C --&gt; F[Leiden 2019: 修补不连通缺陷]&#10;  D --&gt; G[O N^3 慢]&#10;  E --&gt; H[亿级可算]\">graph TD\n  A[社群发现] --&gt; B[子群定义: 派系/k-核]\n  A --&gt; C[模块度优化]\n  C --&gt; D[Girvan-Newman 2002: 删边介数最高边]\n  C --&gt; E[Louvain 2008: 贪心聚合 近线性]\n  C --&gt; F[Leiden 2019: 修补不连通缺陷]\n  D --&gt; G[O N^3 慢]\n  E --&gt; H[亿级可算]</pre><p>工程实现见<a href=\"../../../data-science/network-graph-analysis/metrics/community-detection\">网络与图分析·社群发现</a>；社群结构的一般性质见<a href=\"../../../systems-thinking/network-science/network-properties/community-structure\">网络科学·社群结构</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"难题-重叠社群与分辨率极限\">难题：重叠社群与分辨率极限</h2><p>社群发现远未&quot;解决&quot;，两个根本难题至今活跃：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>重叠社群</strong>：现实中一个人同时属于家庭、公司、球队多个社群，但模块度优化默认硬划分。Palla 等 2005 年的&quot;派系渗流法&quot;（CPM）允许节点属于多个社群，更贴合社会现实。</li>\n<li><strong>分辨率极限</strong>：福尔图纳托（Fortunato）与巴尔泰勒米 2007 年证明，模块度优化存在&quot;分辨率极限&quot;——它会系统性地把小于某尺度的真实社群合并掉，因此不能盲信单一 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 值划分。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>难题</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>应对</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>重叠社群</td>\n<td>硬划分丢失多重归属</td>\n<td>CPM、模糊社群</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分辨率极限</td>\n<td>小社群被强行合并</td>\n<td>多分辨率扫描、参数化模块度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  A[模块度优化] --&gt; B[假设硬划分]&#10;  B --&gt; C[难题1: 无法重叠]&#10;  A --&gt; D[分辨率极限 2007]&#10;  D --&gt; E[小社群被合并]&#10;  C --&gt; F[CPM 允许重叠]&#10;  E --&gt; G[多分辨率扫描]\">flowchart LR\n  A[模块度优化] --&gt; B[假设硬划分]\n  B --&gt; C[难题1: 无法重叠]\n  A --&gt; D[分辨率极限 2007]\n  D --&gt; E[小社群被合并]\n  C --&gt; F[CPM 允许重叠]\n  E --&gt; G[多分辨率扫描]</pre><h2 id=\"权衡与反模式\">权衡与反模式</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>反模式：盲信单一最优划分。</strong> 由于分辨率极限，应在多个分辨率下扫描，并结合领域知识判断社群是否&quot;真实&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>反模式：用派系硬指标在稀疏大网络找社群。</strong> 派系太苛刻，改用模块度/k-核。</li>\n<li><strong>权衡：速度 vs 质量。</strong> Louvain 快但可能产不连通社群，Leiden 更稳但稍慢；亿级网络通常先 Louvain 探索。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>网络由内部紧密、彼此稀疏的社群拼成；子群定义从苛刻的派系放松到 n-派系、k-核（Seidman 1983）、k-丛。</li>\n<li>现代社群发现以最大化模块度 Q（纽曼-吉尔万 2004）为目标；Girvan-Newman（删边介数）慢，Louvain（2008）近线性成事实标准，Leiden（2019）修补不连通缺陷。</li>\n<li>两大未解难题：重叠社群（CPM, Palla 2005）与分辨率极限（Fortunato 2007，小社群被合并）。</li>\n<li>不应盲信单一划分，需多分辨率扫描 + 领域判断；下一节进入连接社群的<a href=\"weak-ties-and-bridges\">弱连带与桥</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"凝聚子群与社群","id":"凝聚子群与社群"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从派系到 k-核：子群的严格定义","id":"从派系到-k-核-子群的严格定义"},{"level":2,"text":"模块度与社群发现算法","id":"模块度与社群发现算法"},{"level":2,"text":"难题：重叠社群与分辨率极限","id":"难题-重叠社群与分辨率极限"},{"level":2,"text":"权衡与反模式","id":"权衡与反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"特征向量中心性与权力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-network-analysis/centrality/eigenvector-and-power"},"next":{"title":"弱连带与桥","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-network-analysis/structure-and-community/weak-ties-and-bridges"}}